@task drop-door-fallback
  meaning
    says "Once @inventarch/mcp-door ships ia_session, ia_catalogue and ia_method, move .mcp.json and the pins to it and drop the lanes' scripts/resolve.mjs fallback. Done in 1.2.0: the 3.5.0 door lists all three tools over stdio (checked 2026-11-01), the door pin is 3.5.0 and the lanes name only the door. scripts/resolve.mjs stays for ia:init, ia:delegate and the kits' own cases; making it a thin caller of the shared runtime's packet builder is not part of this task."
  work
    title "Drop the lanes' resolve.mjs fallback"
    status closed
    milestone @milestone marketplace-published
    owner "Unassigned"
    start "2026-10-30"
    ended "2026-11-01"
    source "docs/roadmap.md"

@task codex-door-and-handlers
  meaning
    says "Give Codex the kit handler hooks once qualified there: a QUALIFIED_CODEX_HOOKS set for bootstrap.mjs and handlers.mjs. The IA door half is done in 1.2.0: the Codex manifest names .codex-mcp.json (decision public-door-codex)."
  work
    title "Carry the kit handlers to Codex"
    status proposed
    milestone @milestone marketplace-published
    owner "Unassigned"
    start "2026-10-30"
    source "docs/roadmap.md"

@task signed-kit-releases
  meaning
    says "Sign kit releases and check the signature before a kit runs code, so trust no longer rests on the kit id's namespace and the release record the kit carries itself, and widen what the signed digest covers to every module a kit's entry scripts import (decision public-kit-trust)."
  work
    title "Trust kit code by signature, not by its namespace claim"
    status proposed
    milestone @milestone marketplace-published
    owner "Unassigned"
    start "2026-10-31"
    source "docs/roadmap.md"

@task codex-account-connector
  meaning
    says "Give Codex the InventArch account connector once its documented plugin MCP config is shown to take a remote HTTP server with the API's pre-registered OAuth client (client id claude-code, callback port 43822) and tools/smoke-codex.mjs can sign in and list kit_offerings. Until then the Codex manifest names only the door (.codex-mcp.json) and Codex users add the server with codex mcp add (decision public-account-connector)."
  work
    title "Carry the account connector to Codex"
    status proposed
    milestone @milestone marketplace-published
    owner "Unassigned"
    start "2026-11-01"
    source "docs/roadmap.md"

