@task qualify-account-connector
  meaning
    says "In a real Claude Code session: the plugin's inventarch server appears in /mcp and signs in with client id claude-code on callback port 43822; kit_offerings and kit_download answer under mcp__plugin_ia_inventarch__*; and a downloaded archive is a kit folder tarball that kit.mjs add --from accepts (its releases.json at the root or in its one folder). Record the observed kit_offerings shape in ia:init section 6."
  work
